# Quantum AI — Frontend

React chat UI for the Quantum AI Assistant API.

**Port:** `5175`  
**URL:** `http://localhost:5175`

## Setup

```powershell
cd frontend
npm install
```

Optional: copy `.env.example` to `.env` (defaults work in dev via Vite proxy).

## Run

```powershell
npm run dev      # development
npm run build    # production build
npm run preview  # preview production build
```

> **Note:** The backend must be running on port **5001**. Vite proxies `/api` to `http://localhost:5001`.

## Auth

Quantum AI uses its **own** Sign up / Sign in screen (teal ocean branding). Create an account in the AI app — you no longer need QuantumChat messenger credentials.

## Features

- Streaming AI chat
- Conversation history
- Document upload (PDF, DOCX, TXT, etc.)
- Summarize documents
- Generate PowerPoint from PDFs

